00:23:40.280 --> 00:23:41.490
Where should they go?

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:43.530
What's the best way
of getting started?

00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:45.613
MATHIAS MEYER: If you have
an open source project,

00:23:45.613 --> 00:23:47.960
simply go to Travis-CI.org,
and, you know,

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:50.167
sign in with your GitHub
account, and get started.

00:23:50.167 --> 00:23:51.750
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Yeah, it is very easy

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.280
and is totally worth it,
if you haven't tried it.

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:54.870
I agree.

